## Final Thoughts

Your website is an important part of your online presence, but people need to be able to find it.

SEO helps search engines understand your pages and gives your business opportunities to appear when people search for relevant products, services, and information.

It is not a magic switch that immediately puts your business at the top of Google. It is an ongoing process involving useful content, technical improvements, relevant information, and a good website experience.

If you're building a website for your business, SEO should be considered from the beginning rather than treated as an optional extra after launch.

